wob, a lightweight overlay bar for Wayland: reads percentages from stdin and shows a bar (volume, brightness...). Needs a compositor with wlr-layer-shell. Built without seccomp and the systemd unit files.
example: wpctl-less volume bar: echo 50 | wob
upstream: https://github.com/francma/wob
